  "title": "Counterweight Crew",
  "rules": [
    "Attach beside cargo, then cardinal actions exert force; release restores free walking.",
    "Heavy cargo needs net force two; light cargo needs one. Opposed force cancels; equal axis magnitude selects x.",
    "Workers can share cells. Cargo cannot enter another active cargo or a non-tethered worker; walls and tether footprints constrain travel.",
    "Rest restores two stamina up to ten; direction costs one even when collective motion fails.",
    "Any depot accepts cargo and pays each worker its own public value times cargo weight, then removes cargo and releases tethers.",
    "All cargo delivered ends naturally; otherwise horizon 80."
  ],
